      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَضَّنْتُهُ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَغْضِينٌ</span>, <i>I wrinkled, shrivelled,</i>
or <i>puckered, it</i> syn. of the inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَشْنِيجٌ</span>. (S.)
One says. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَخَلْتُ عَلَيْهِ فَغَضَّنَ لِى مِنْ جَبْهَتِه</span> [<i>I
went in to him and be wrinkled to me a portion of
his (??)</i>] (TA) ― 
